documentation/site/
# Local limitations notes are not part of the published project documentation.
**/*LIMITATIONS*.md
**/*limitations*.md
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Private local projects, databases, exports, and backups
.data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
backups/
exports/
local-assets/
